/**
 * Module 13 — Ultrasound Artefacts.
 *
 * The artefact workshop. Every artefact is generated by breaking the machine
 * assumption that causes it: the scene shows the true physics and beam path,
 * and the B-mode panel beside it shows what the machine drew. Enhancement and
 * shadowing genuinely EMERGE from the attenuation model; beam-path artefacts
 * are shown as the extra targets the machine placed, with the reveal overlay
 * exposing the difference between the true path and the assumed straight line.
 */

